{
    "title": "8 Ball Shoot It All - 3D Pool",
    "description": "First-ever in pool gaming with 3D graphics & real-time 3D Zoom! So authentic, you feel like you're at a real pool table, cue in hand, aiming for a victorious shot! \r\n\r\nExplore a world of free 8 ball pool game & play between classic 2D pool or awesome realistic 3D pool. \r\n\r\n<b>Real Pool 3D. </b> Top-class 8-ball pool game, offering real-time 3D online game. Enjoy 3D online multiplayer battle, thrill of billiards 3D pool, real pool & online pool.\r\n\r\n<b>Zoom while taking shots, </b> making play as real as actual pool table. Be pool king & strike in billiards city where infinity 8 ball adventures await. With realistic pool-8, be eight-ball champion.\r\n\r\n<b>Master Spin & Curved Shots in Poll. </b> Enjoy breakshot pool & shooting ball games. Our physics, ball physics bring new realm to sports games. In multiplayer games!, snooker game shooting every ballz feel real. \r\n\r\n<b>Add detail & accuracy with Chalks. </b> Raise your match in 8 ball clash & top 8 pool stars with moonshot 8 ball. Fine your trick shot in world of billiards, using snooker tactics.\r\n\r\n<b>Elevate Cue for Challenging Shots. </b>. Face off in 1-vs-1 eight ball pool. \r\n\r\n<b>Classic pool meets modern biliard. </b> Enjoy classic billiard match with friends & family. 8ball pool or 8 pool, we cater to every core ball enthusiast. Join casual games in clubs. Snoker lovers, rejoice!\r\n\r\n<b>Play with Friends, Millions Online. </b> Connect in 8 Ball live to play in 2D games / 3D games. Become king of pol in multiplayer games online. Dive into imessage games for social, mobile experience. Games for free & faster than ever, pull brings friends & family. Make new friends as you navigate games to play with friends online in this juego de billar.\r\n\r\n<b>Challenge Mode </b> or 8 Ball smash, a fusion of poll & mini-game with exciting unique elements. Dive into pool empire, clash with opponents, conquer pooking games +. Billar pool & game pigion lovers will enjoy bowling & bomberman elements. Snooker meets arcade, enjoy hottest infinity challenges. Be a lover of stunning gameplay, superstar in strategy & puzzles to pot your way in mini games.\r\n\r\n<b>Play Online. </b> Step up exciting world of online games, 8 ball online. Our 8 ball pool online game offers an immersive experience. Enjoy free online games, with online pool. Make your mark in online 8 ball world!\r\n\r\n<b>Play Offline 8 Ball. </b> No wifi, no internet. Enjoy 8 ball billiard offline, where you sharpen your skills in free offline games. \r\n\r\n<b>Play AI in Billiard Pool </b> in ofline games. Perfect your technique in juego de billar, imsg games. \r\n\r\n<b>Single Player or Multiplayer games. </b> Unlock new levels & rewards in turn-based sports adventure. We\u2019re the go-to destination for online pool.\r\n\r\n<b>Play in diverse 8 ball arena </b> with unique billiards 8 ball. Travel royal pool world, master shooting ball.\r\n\r\n<b>Unique cues, cue sticks, tables.</b> In bola 8, blackball, right cue is imp. Play classic english pool on pool tables. \r\n\r\n<b>Become a Pool Master.</b> Dive into underground world of pool blitz where 8 ball blitz challenges await. Improve skills in billar & poll, making 8pool. game master. Navigate through juegos de billar online multiplayer games. \r\n\r\n<b>Rank up daily & weekly leaderboard tournaments.</b> Play in one pocket & bank pool matches, showcasing pooking skills. Collect trophies, climb rankings in 1-on-1 proving your prowess in pvp & pvps.\r\n\r\n<b>Daily & Weekly Quests for Fun,</b> from pub pool to Bowlliards thrills. Enjoy free games with unique twist to traditional pol. Master eight ball.\r\n\r\n<b>Unlock golden chest</b>, magical chest & giant chest for rewards. Enhance your pool-8 skills off line. Dive into world of game pigeon & clash with pool aces. \r\n\r\n<b>Pass n Play on Same Device with Friends.</b> Our games offline, including 8 ball pool offline, offline pool, are designed for fun & no wifi games.\r\n\r\nIn future you\u2019ll find, Seven-Ball, Fifteen-Ball, & Baseball Billiards, 9 ball. This eight-ball game will pull you in on count of tres, dos, uno!",
